nts (no external assets or fonts).\n- Design review completed and assets handed off to dashboard engineering.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- Enables the P0 HLRs for the create form wizard, management list page, detail view, delete\n  flow, and status tracking, and the P1 viewer-browsing HLR (UI treatment of write controls),\n  by providing the designs those UIs are built against. Does not itself deliver an HLR.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":42504,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-98b7402301a08c80","agent_id":"a1cc435330cc27217","session_id":"ca7cb4a8-97e2-442a-8df6-df0a1f4664f3","uuid":"805f78ae-f86f-4a26-8f04-5a9922e632a2","timestamp":"2026-10-22T09:14:21.303Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8007"}
