write controls not rendered for non-admins), with the\n  wizard reachable only through the admin-gated route.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- Given a platform administrator, opening the create flow shows a guided wizard rendering\n  all fields required by the decided field-set specification without error, and submitting\n  produces a valid `FeatureStore` CR accepted by the K8s API.\n- Inline validation provides guidance for CRD schema constraints (required fields, valid\n  backend combinations, scaling prerequisites) before submission.\n- If the K8s API rejects a submitted CR, the validation error is surfaced in the form.\n- The wizard functions with no external network access — form options, validation rules, and\n  UI assets are bundled at build time.\n- Non-admin users cannot reach the create flow (write controls and admin route enforcement).\n- The prototype's reusable elements have been assessed and reused or consciously discarded\n  with rationale.\n- Form fields validated against the feast.dev/v1 CRD OpenAPI schema.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- P0: deploy a new FeatureStore instance from the dashboard via a guided form wizard.\n- P2: inline form validation guidance for CRD schema constraints (bundled — shares the same\n  form surface and validation logic).\n- P1 (shared): disconnected/air-gapped functioning of the admin UI.\n\nDepends on: the decided field-set and validation-constraint specification, and the UXD\nwireframes/interaction patterns for the wizard. The RBAC/feature-flag configuration changes\nrun in parallel; correct admin permissions are verified by this epic's acceptance criteria\nrather than a work dependency.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":42504,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-98b7402301a08c80","agent_id":"a1cc435330cc27217","session_id":"ca7cb4a8-97e2-442a-8df6-df0a1f4664f3","uuid":"b208eb5d-1676-4481-9187-52ac9f2c48fe","times