{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-af801ed8c994803e","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8007\n3\tepic_count: 8\n4\tcritical_path_length: 4\n5\tdecompose_complete: true\n6\trevised: false\n7\ttriage: null\n8\ttriage_rationale: null\n9\t---\n10\t# Decomposition Summary — RHAISTRAT-8007\n11\t\n12\tFeature Store Admin UI — Self-Service Instance Deployment and Management\n13\t\n14\t## Triage\n15\t\n16\tNot below-threshold: although the code change concentrates in odh-dashboard, the strategy spans\n17\tmultiple distinct work streams (React frontend pages, RBAC/kustomize manifests, UXD design\n18\tauthoring, cross-team validation, admin-guide documentation) and contains genuine unknowns\n19\t(open questions on form field curation and backend-combination restrictions) whose answers\n20\tchange what the create-form epic does. Not docs-only: odh-dashboard requires code changes.\n21\t\n22\tStaff Engineer Input section contains only template placeholder text — no overrides to apply.\n23\t\n24\t## Component Mapping\n25\t\n26\tCanonical component names from `.context/rhai-components.txt`:\n27\t\n28\t| Strategy component | Canonical component | Notes |\n29\t|---|---|---|\n30\t| odh-dashboard (frontend / backend / manifests) | AI Core Dashboard | Closest canonical name for the RHOAI dashboard; all three strategy rows map here |\n31\t| feast-operator | Feature Store | No code changes expected — passive component validated by a different team |\n32\t| UXD design assets | UXD | |\n33\t| QE test suites | QE | |\n34\t| Admin guides | Documentation | |\n35\t\n36\tBoth odh-dashboard and feast exist in `.context/architecture-context/` (odh-dashboard.md,\n37\tfeast.md, feast-module-operator.md) — no new-component onboarding chain is needed.\n38\t\n39\t## Epic List\n40\t\n41\t| ID | Title | Type | Team | Priority |\n42\t|---|---|---|---|---|\n43\t| RHAISTRAT-8007-E001 | Determine FeatureStore CRD field exposure and