{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b754033adffa06d6","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8007-E002\n3\ttitle: UXD wireframes and interaction patterns for Feature Store admin UI\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8007\n5\tcomponent: UXD\n6\tteam: UXD Team\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tdependencies: []\n10\tai_signals:\n11\t  change_specificity: 0\n12\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n13\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n14\t  existing_foundation: 1\n15\t  open_questions: 0\n16\t  external_dependency: 0\n17\t  human_process_gates: -1\n18\t  repo_access: 0\n19\t  architecture_claims: 0\n20\timplementation_type: null\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: Medium\n23\tai_implementability_score: 1\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# UXD wireframes and interaction patterns for Feature Store admin UI\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tCreate the UX design assets for the Feature Store admin management surface in the RHOAI\n34\tdashboard: wireframes and interaction patterns for the create form wizard, the instance\n35\tmanagement list page, and the read-only detail/inspect view (including the delete\n36\tconfirmation dialog). The `needs-uxd` label on the source RFE tracks this work. The existing\n37\tengineering prototype (odh-dashboard draft PR #7013) serves as a starting design reference to\n38\tunblock progress while formal designs are produced.\n39\t\n40\t## Scope\n41\t\n42\t- Wireframes for the Feature Store management page: instance list (name, namespace, status,\n43\t  creation timestamp), row actions, and status presentation for deploying/ready states.\n44\t- Wireframes and interaction patterns for the guided create form wizard: step structure,\n45\t  field grouping across namespace, registry type, online/offline store backends,\n46\t  authorization mode, and scaling parameters, and inline validation presentation.\n47\t- Wireframes for the read-only detail/inspect view and the delete confirmation dialog.\n48\t- Interaction guidance for the admin vs viewer distinction (write controls hidden for\n49\t  non-admin users).\n50\t- Design review with dashboard engineering and product management; handoff-ready specs.\n51\t\n52\t## Acceptance Criteria\n53\t\n54\t- Wireframes exist for the create wizard, management list page, detail view, and delete\n55\t  confirmation dialog.\n56\t- Interaction patterns cover status/readiness presentation and real-time updates without\n57\t  manual refresh.\n58\t- Designs account for disconnected/air-gapped constraints (no external assets or fonts).\n59\t- Design review completed and assets handed off to dashboard engineering.\n60\t\n61\t## HLR Traceability\n62\t\n63\t- Enables the P0 HLRs for the create form wizard, management list page, detail view, delete\n64\t  flow, and status tracking, and the P1 viewer-browsing HLR (UI treatment of write controls),\n65\t  by providing the designs those UIs are built against. Does not itself deliver an HLR.\n66\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-87a86ab7efa4cc07","agent_id":"aba39eb4d9d2cfbec","session_id":"ca7cb4a8-97e2-442a-8df6-df0a1f4664f3","uuid":"2e0861fa-531a-49eb-b15f-281cc5b52a11","timestamp":"2026-10-22T09:18:28.741Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b754033adffa06d6","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-8007 decomposition"}
