{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bf8eed290e67ade3","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8007-E007\n3\ttitle: QE validation of Feature Store admin UI (CRUD, RBAC tiers, disconnected)\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8007\n5\tcomponent: QE\n6\tteam: QE Team\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-8007-E003\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-8007-E004\n12\t- RHAISTRAT-8007-E005\n13\t- RHAISTRAT-8007-E006\n14\tai_signals:\n15\t  change_specificity: 1\n16\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n17\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n18\t  existing_foundation: 1\n19\t  open_questions: 1\n20\t  external_dependency: 0\n21\t  human_process_gates: 0\n22\t  repo_access: 1\n23\t  architecture_claims: 0\n24\timplementation_type: null\n25\tinvestigation_signals: null\n26\tai_implementability: High\n27\tai_implementability_score: 5\n28\tjira_key: null\n29\tbranch: null\n30\tgated_by: null\n31\tgate_failure_impact: null\n32\t---\n33\t# QE validation of Feature Store admin UI (CRUD, RBAC tiers, disconnected)\n34\t\n35\t## Description\n36\t\n37\tFunctionally validate the Feature Store admin UI in the RHOAI dashboard: the full admin CRUD\n38\tflows, RBAC enforcement across admin and viewer tiers, status tracking accuracy, and\n39\tbehavior in a disconnected/air-gapped deployment. The deliverable is a QE validation report\n40\t(automated where the dashboard's e2e suites allow, manual otherwise) covering the strategy's\n41\tacceptance criteria end to end.\n42\t\n43\t## Scope\n44\t\n45\t- Functional testing of admin flows: create via the guided wizard, list across accessible\n46\t  namespaces, read-only inspect, delete with confirmation, and real-time status progression\n47\t  (Deploying → Ready) from `.status.conditions`.\n48\t- RBAC enforcement testing: admin full CRUD; viewer (non-admin) read-only — no create/delete\n49\t  controls in the UI and write attempts refused at the K8s API with the viewer's token.\n50\t- Disconnected/air-gapped environment validation: deploy a FeatureStore instance from the\n51\t  dashboard on an air-gapped cluster with no external connectivity (no form options,\n52\t  validation rules, or UI assets requiring external access).\n53\t- Status tracking accuracy: list matches cluster state within the watch/poll cycle.\n54\t- Regression check that clusters without the Feast component enabled see no UI changes\n55\t  (feature flag default off).\n56\t\n57\t## Acceptance Criteria\n58\t\n59\t- All admin CRUD flows pass functional validation on a live cluster, with results mapped to\n60\t  the strategy's acceptance criteria.\n61\t- Viewer-tier tests confirm read-only access both at the UI level and via direct K8s API\n62\t  attempts with a non-admin token.\n63\t- A FeatureStore instance is successfully deployed from the dashboard on an air-gapped\n64\t  cluster with no external connectivity.\n65\t- Dashboard pod resource consumption is monitored and reported (strategy risk item: added\n66\t  React pages must not materially grow memory/startup of the dashboard pod).\n67\t- Validation report published with pass/fail per strategy acceptance criterion and any\n68\t  defects filed.\n69\t\n70\t## HLR Traceability\n71\t\n72\t- Validates all P0 HLRs (deploy, view, inspect, delete, status tracking), the P1 viewer\n73\t  browsing HLR, and the P1 disconnected/air-gapped HLR. Does not itself deliver an HLR.\n74\t\n75\tDepends on: the completed admin UI implementation (create wizard, management pages) and the\n76\tRBAC/feature-flag configuration; the Feature Store operator validation findings inform the\n77\tdelete-flow and cleanup checks.\n78\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-87a86ab7efa4cc07","agent_id":"aba39eb4d9d2cfbec","session_id":"ca7cb4a8-97e2-442a-8df6-df0a1f4664f3","uuid":"e4aa0722-1d46-4d26-9f84-d51be30d44db","timestamp":"2026-10-22T09:18:36.326Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bf8eed290e67ade3","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config